    "innovation": "This paper uses detailed glaciological observations along a 70 km flow line on the Brunt Ice Shelf to demonstrate that an average of 1 meter of ice melts from beneath the shelf each year, suggesting bottom melting is more widespread and significant than previously suspected.",
